# NOTE: entrypoint.sh MUST be included in the build context (do not add it here).
# extraLib/ and baseLib/ are LOCAL-run only: in the image /extlib and /baselib are
# auto-populated (entrypoint downloads WATER_MODULES; Dockerfile seeds /baselib), so the
# in-repo folders must NOT enter the Docker build context.
